    "content": "<p>In honor of the MY.GAMES anniversary, War Robots: Frontiers is hosting exciting events to celebrate six years of gaming until <strong>June 9.</strong></p>\r\n\r\n<p><strong><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://static-eu.prod-my.games/chronos-public-eu-wrf-prod/site/2025/05/215-MGAnniversary/1.png\" /></strong></p>\r\n\r\n<h2>Anniversary Events&nbsp;</h2>\r\n\r\n<h3>Battle Bonus Event</h3>\r\n\r\n<p>From <strong>May 26 (10:00 CEST/01:00 PT) to June 9 (10:00 CEST/01:00 PT),</strong> log in daily and play Battles to secure cosmic cosmetic rewards like <strong>Paint, Stickers, and Wraps!</strong></p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><strong><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://static-eu.prod-my.games/chronos-public-eu-wrf-prod/site/2025/05/215-MGAnniversary/2.png\" /><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://static-eu.prod-my.games/chronos-public-eu-wrf-prod/site/2025/05/215-MGAnniversary/3.png\" /></strong></p>\r\n\r\n<h3>Intel Discount Event</h3>\r\n\r\n<p>From <strong>May 23 (10:00 CEST/01:00 PT) to June 3 (10:00 CEST/01:00 PT)</strong>, the Intel cost for upgrading <strong>Orochi and Phantom Modules, Weapons, and Supply and Cycle Gear </strong>will be reduced. Check out all the details <a href=\"https://warrobotsfrontiers.com/news/218\">here</a>.</p>\r\n\r\n<h3>Free Gift</h3>\r\n\r\n<p>Redeem the promo code &ldquo;<strong>GOTYOUR6</strong>&rdquo; for Regal Eagle (Paint) and a 3-day Premium Account<strong> (ends June 17, 14:00 CEST/05:00 PT).</strong></p>\r\n\r\n<p>Enjoy the anniversary events, Pilots!</p>\r\n\r\n<hr />\r\n<p><strong>Download War Robots: Frontiers for free today:</strong></p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><a href=\"https://warrobotsfrontiers.com/l/playstation\"><strong>PlayStation&reg;5</strong></a><strong>│</strong><a href=\"https://warrobotsfrontiers.com/l/playstation\"><strong>PlayStation&reg;4</strong></a><strong>│ </strong><a href=\"https://warrobotsfrontiers.com/l/xbox\"><strong>Xbox Series X|S&trade;</strong></a><strong> │</strong><a href=\"https://warrobotsfrontiers.com/l/xbox\"><strong>Xbox One&trade;</strong></a></p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><a href=\"https://warrobotsfrontiers.com/l/steam\"><strong>Steam</strong></a><strong> │ </strong><a href=\"https://my.games/play/war_robots_frontiers_mg\"><strong>MY.GAMES Launcher</strong></a></p>\r\n\r\n<p>Stay tuned to our official <a href=\"https://x.com/WRFrontiers\">X</a>, <a href=\"https://www.facebook.com/wrfrontiers\">Facebook</a>, <a href=\"https://www.instagram.com/wrfrontiers/\">Instagram</a>, <a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/channel/UC7xxqQkPAQ7x6wIVEPZus5w\">YouTube</a>, and <a href=\"https://www.tiktok.com/@wrfrontiers\">TikTok</a> channels, and join the <a href=\"https://www.reddit.com/r/warrobotsfrontiers/\">War Robots: Frontiers subreddit</a> and <a href=\"https://warrobotsfrontiers.com/l/discord\">Discord</a> for all the latest news and updates.</p>",
